## Steps

1. **Entry check.** Run `uv run rmf status <run>`: {{ t.id }} is the next action, and
{% if deps %}
   {{ deps | map(attribute="id") | join(", ") }} {{ "is" if deps | length == 1 else "are" }} done or out of scope.
{% else %}
   nothing in the run comes before it.
{% endif %}
   Entry criteria (from `framework/tasks/{{ t.step }}.yaml`):
{% for c in t.entry_criteria %}
   - {{ c }}
{% endfor %}
   If one is not met, stop and journal a NOTE (`00-run-protocol.md`, stop conditions). Why:
   the task builds on those results, and working around a gap leaves claims nobody can
   trace.
2. **Read the inputs** listed in `## Inputs`, and the passages in `## Citations` that say
   what {{ t.id }} must achieve. The purpose in the header states the outcome.
{% if alignment %}
   {{ t.id }} feeds {% for a in alignment %}{{ a.id }} ({{ a.name }}, {{ a.kind }}){{ ", " if not loop.last else "" }}{% endfor %}; what it
   records must be ready for {{ "that event" if alignment | length == 1 else "those events" }}.
{% endif %}
   Why: the playbook is generic, so the inputs and the cited text set the content.
3. **Interview** following `_shared/interviewing.md` (and `_shared/hybrid-mode.md` in a
   `hybrid` run). Start with the responsible (R) personas in `## Interviews`. Take the
   questions from each persona card's `## Question bank by step` for step {{ t.step }}
   ({{ step.name }}) and point them at what the exit criteria in `## Done when` need and the
   inputs leave open.
{% if t.min_interviews %}
   Write at least {{ t.min_interviews }} interview file(s) with `task: {{ t.id }}`.
{% else %}
   The task needs no interview; interview only to fill a gap the inputs leave open.
{% endif %}
   Why: answers are the evidence that artifacts cite (`INT-###.A#`).
{% if outputs %}
4. **Write the outputs** in `## Outputs`, each file whole (INV-8), every claim traced per
   `_shared/tagging-and-traceability.md`:
{% for o in outputs %}
{% if o.generated %}
   - {{ o.id }} ({{ o.name }}) is generated: run `{{ o.generator or "uv run rmf build <run>" }}` and never edit
     its output (INV-2).
{% elif o.produces %}
   - **{{ o.id }}** ({{ o.name }}): {{ o.description }}
     Read `{{ o.template }}`, replace every `<<FILL: ...>>` placeholder, delete the template
     comment, and write `{{ o.md }}` with `produced_by_task: {{ t.id }}` and
     `touched_by: [{{ t.id }}]`.
{% for d in o.data %}
     Write `{{ d.path }}` whole{% if d.schema %} (schema `framework/schema/{{ d.schema }}.schema.json`{% if d.template %}, template `{{ d.template }}`{% endif %}){% endif %}; summarize its records in the Markdown by ID instead of copying them.
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
   - **{{ o.id }}** ({{ o.name }}, updated): Read `{{ o.md }}`, append `{{ t.id }}` to
     `touched_by`, add a `## {{ t.name }} ({{ t.id }})` section with what this task
     established, and write the whole file back. Keep every earlier section.
{% for d in o.data %}
     Rewrite `{{ d.path }}` whole{% if d.schema %} (schema `framework/schema/{{ d.schema }}.schema.json`){% endif %} when this task changes its records; keep the records other tasks wrote.
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if outputs | rejectattr("generated") | list %}
   Why: `rmf status` counts {{ t.id }} done only when every output lists it in `touched_by`.
{% else %}
   Why: `rmf status` counts {{ t.id }} done only when the generated output exists.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
4. **Record the result.** {{ t.id }} has no artifact output: its record is the interview
   files, which must hold what the exit criteria in `## Done when` name, so later tasks
   can cite the answers. When a persona makes a decision, also journal a DECISION entry
   (`_shared/journaling-and-lessons.md`).
{% endif %}
{% if t.writes_facts %}
5. **Write the facts** in `## Facts`: rewrite `facts.yaml` whole, keeping every field
   other tasks wrote, with `set_by_task: {{ t.id }}` and the answers in `sources`.
{% else %}
5. **Leave `facts.yaml` alone.** {{ t.id }} writes no facts (INV-4).
{% endif %}
6. **Build and check.** `uv run rmf build <run>`, then `uv run rmf check <run> --task {{ t.id }}`,
   until 0 errors (INV-6).
7. **Journal** a CHECKPOINT (`## Journal and lessons`).

